# Everything in here is deliberately COMMITTED. The skill is the product:
# someone copies this folder and it answers questions offline, immediately,
# with no clone and no build step. Ignoring any of it breaks that promise.
#
#   rules.json   the parsed rulebook. Committed so a rules update arrives as a
#                reviewable diff of rule ids, rather than as a wrong citation
#                discovered months later.
#   cards.json   card text + artwork URLs (URLs only; no image is redistributed)
#   rules.html   the anchored rulebook that report citations link into
